CUDA PPCG regression using the structure, numerical settings and reference of
CPU Autotest case 823_PW_PPCG_USPP_HCl. Only device=gpu and explicit
double precision are added; the standard acceptance tolerances are unchanged.

The reference was computed independently with BPCG. At the deliberately strict
SCF threshold, eigensolver iteration-limit warnings near the residual roundoff
floor remain visible; the energy, force and stress checks are independent.
